            <div xml:id="d431">

                <pb facs="0600" n="504" xml:id="pg504"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.51/693: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-12-27T17:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">December 27,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 9:19 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>215. Eduardo Iturbide left for New York last night as Obregon’s representative to
                    resume the financial discussions initiated with Lamont last October. Iturbide
                    informed me that he has very full powers.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
